  "description": "Cute Story Font is a fun, playful, and bold bubble font designed to bring a cheerful and youthful feel to your creative projects. With its chunky rounded shapes and friendly appearance, this font is perfect for kids’ designs, party graphics, educational materials, apparel, posters, stickers, invitations, greeting cards, logos, and social media artwork.\nIts soft and bubbly letterforms create a cute, energetic, and approachable look that works especially well for children’s branding and playful typography projects. Perfect for Cricut, Silhouette, print-on-demand, classroom projects, crafts, and digital designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Cute Story Font is a fun, playful, and bold bubble font designed to bring a cheerful and youthful feel to your creative projects. With its chunky rounded shapes and friendly appearance, this font is perfect for kids’ designs, party graphics, educational materials, apparel, posters, stickers, invitations, greeting cards, logos, and social media artwork.</p>\n<p>Its soft and bubbly letterforms create a cute, energetic, and approachable look that works especially well for children’s branding and playful typography projects. Perfect for Cricut, Silhouette, print-on-demand, classroom projects, crafts, and digital designs.</p>",
